# The sidecar directory holds downloaded engines, which are reproducible.
#
# The one exception used to be the vendored alpha, committed here because its
# rolling prerelease URL stops existing. It moved to `vendor/build-inputs/` on
# 2026-10-29 (docs/operate/VENDORED-BUILD-INPUTS.md) and `prebuild.mjs` copies it
# in, so every file in this directory is now a build artifact and nothing here
# needs un-ignoring. Nothing is committed from this directory.
sidecar/*
